Mana scripts

These tell Zell how much each coding provider has left when it cannot read
the number itself. Give the percentage LEFT, from 0 to 100.

  set-mana codex 62           Codex has 62% left
  set-mana grok 40 codex 100  several at once
  set-mana all 50             all three
  set-mana                    be asked for each one
  show-mana                   what is set by hand now
  clear-mana                  forget every value set by hand
  clear-mana codex            forget only Codex's

A value set by hand stands until you clear it, set it again, or Zell takes a
good automatic reading after it. Such a reading retires the value for good.
If your shell does not find a script, start it with ./ as in ./set-mana. The Mana console and the MANA bar show the
change within a few seconds.
